Mobi 4.2: The RTX Knowledge Graph Launchpad

Mobi is our central platform for all ontologies, now enhanced to be a full-featured environment for Proof of Concepts.

    Unified Platform: The go-to place for all RTX ontologies, accessible to all stakeholders.

    End-to-End Capability:

        Design: Build and manage ontologies.

        Build: Map data and create knowledge graphs directly within the platform.

        Query: Analyze graphs using a full SPARQL endpoint.

    Powerful & Scalable:

        Functions as a native RDF Triplestore.

        Handles POCs up to 50 GB / 500 Million Triples.

    Low-Risk Innovation:

        Zero Initial Tool Cost: Teams can start building immediately.

        Production Ready: Full REST API for integration and established pathways to transition successful POCs to enterprise tools like Anzo and Stardog.
